<title>USA: Simpson names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Simpson names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>PLYMOUTH, Mich. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simpson Industries Inc said Friday it had named Vinod Khilnani as chief financial officer, effective July 16.</p>
<p>Khilnani, 44, most recently was CFO of Dayton Superior Corp in Miamisburg, Ohio.</p>
<p>Simpson officials were not available to provide information Khilnani's predecessor as CFO.</p>
<p>Simpson makes powertrain and chassis products for the automotive and medium and heavy-duty engine markets.</p>
</text>
